codex
The short direct-shebang venv exposed a second harness-specific issue: Homebrew Python 3.11’s base installation contains a symlinked global `coloredlogs.pth`, which the driver correctly refuses to bind. The previously accepted native fixtures used the clean Python 3.14 base. I’m recreating that exact clean interpreter layout with the new wheel; these failures are fail-closed identity checks, not regressions from the patch.
