codex
The fixture now builds a real synthetic Windows CPython layout (`python.exe`, one runtime DLL, `Lib`, and the manager package tree), while unsupported hosts still use only a test-local identity seam. I’ve also separated POSIX-only process-group/shebang assertions and made the teardown fake independent of `SIGKILL`, which Windows does not expose.
