.resources/TASK-260729-1t1z2l/TASK-260729-1t1z2l_curator-go-to-csk-parity-delta.md-230-`protocol/core.md` §4.2.1 requires `manager-worker-v1` on macOS and Windows. `rc5-native-control-inventory-v1` is marked `exhaustive: true` and covers exactly `["macos", "windows"]`. Accepted Curator `internal/godriver/controls_other.go` (build tag `!darwin && !windows`) fails closed on every other host: `prepareControlDomain` returns `CodeControlUnavailable` with "the portable execution policy is specified for macOS and Windows only", and `probeNativeControl` rejects before the worker starts. A source-aware `go-v1` build therefore **cannot succeed on Linux** under the accepted contract.
