.resources/TASK-260729-osjeay/TASK-260729-osjeay_final-ci-execution-map-rev6.md-2753-  its own line, which a batch file parses only after the previous line has run.
.resources/TASK-260729-osjeay/TASK-260729-osjeay_final-ci-execution-map-rev6.md-2754-- a batch file that ends in a bare `endlocal` does **not** propagate `%RC%`, so
.resources/TASK-260729-osjeay/TASK-260729-osjeay_final-ci-execution-map-rev6.md:2755:  `ssh win "cmd /c …"` can exit 0 over a failed suite. The file must end
