+| Full `python -m pytest -q` | Windows, Python 3.14.4 | 0 | 1,064 passed, 116 skips in 307.02 s |
+| Focused accepted-root go-v1 unit suite | macOS arm64, Python 3.11.14 | 0 | 141 passed |
